---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<Layout title="Free Breckenridge Ski Resort RSVP | Breck Sky Fest" description="Free RSVP for the main Breck Sky Fest program at Breckenridge Ski Resort on November 28, 2026. Explore the separate $57 VIP experience at Beaver Run.">
<PageIntro eyebrow="Free admission · $0" title="RSVP for the main Breck program." description="Saturday, November 28, 2026 · Breckenridge Ski Resort · Quicksilver chair base area. Daytime solar astronomy and evening stargazing. Times: To Be Announced." icon="stars"/>
<section class="section paper-section"><div class="wrap"><p>RSVP is required so we can plan ahead, provide enough equipment for everyone, and let you know about important weather updates, including postponement or cancellation. The event is free; there is no payment step. Program times and arrival details will be announced.</p><p>Looking for a smaller group and festival extras? <a class="text-link" href="/program/vip-stargazing-beaver-run/">Explore VIP Stargazing at Beaver Run · $57 per person</a>. The VIP program is booked separately through AstroTours.</p><form class="rsvp-form" id="breck-rsvp" action="/api/rsvp" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="event" value="breck"/><label for="attendee-name">Attendee name</label><input id="attendee-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required/><label for="attendee-email">Email address</label><input id="attendee-email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required/><label for="attendee-phone">Phone number (optional)</label><input id="attendee-phone" type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="50" aria-describedby="phone-help"/><p id="phone-help" style="font-size:1rem">Provide a number where the festival team can reach you about this event or important weather updates.</p><label for="attendee-count">Number of people attending (including you)</label><input id="attendee-count" type="number" inputmode="numeric" name="people" min="1" max="500" step="1" value="1" required/><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Leave this blank</label><input id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></div><p class="small" style="margin-top:20px;font-size:1rem">Your name, email, phone number if provided, and group size will be stored by the festival team for attendance planning and updates about this event.</p><button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Submit free RSVP · $0</button><p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form><div class="rsvp-confirmation" id="rsvp-confirmation" tabindex="-1" hidden><h2>You’re on the list.</h2><p>Your free RSVP has been saved for the main Breck Sky Fest program at Breckenridge Ski Resort on Saturday, November 28, 2026.</p><p>Times are To Be Announced. We’ll use your email for program details and important weather updates.</p><p id="rsvp-reference"></p><a class="text-link" href="/program/community-stargazing/">Back to event details</a></div><p style="margin-top:30px"><a class="text-link" href="/program/community-stargazing/">See the full event details</a></p></div></section>
<script>
const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#breck-rsvp');
form?.addEventListener('submit',async(event)=>{event.preventDefault();if(!form.reportValidity())return;const button=form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('button[type="submit"]')!;const status=form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.form-status')!;button.disabled=true;status.textContent='Saving your RSVP…';try{const response=await fetch(form.action,{method:'POST',body:new FormData(form),headers:{Accept:'application/json'}});const result=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(result.error||'Unable to save your RSVP. Please try again.');form.hidden=true;const confirmation=document.getElementById('rsvp-confirmation')!;document.getElementById('rsvp-reference')!.textContent=`RSVP reference: ${result.id}`;confirmation.hidden=false;confirmation.focus();}catch(error){status.textContent=error instanceof Error?error.message:'Unable to save your RSVP. Please try again.';}finally{button.disabled=false;}});
</script>
</Layout>
